1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,320
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,760
=The One=

16
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,320
=Episode 20=

17
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,759
What are you doing here?

18
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:50,640
Why are you here so early?

19
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:56,840
Got them on my morning run.

20
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,119
Your favorite flowers.

21
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,079
It's the weekend.

22
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,400
Let's go on

23
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:06,560
a proper date today.

24
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,239
Okay.

25
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:22,560
♪Why do you act so sweet?♪

26
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:25,040
♪Then goof off for the camera?♪

27
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,600
♪The evening breeze confesses♪

28
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,080
♪I love how you cling to me♪

29
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,880
♪I wait for every sweet word you say♪

30
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,240
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

31
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,920
♪Makes me a little shy♪

32
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:35,960
♪When you say you love me♪

33
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,600
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

34
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:40,040
♪Slowly, you come closer to me♪

35
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,319
Ready?

36
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,200
It's getting warmer,

37
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,079
and your hands are still so cold.

38
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:52,439
They're not that cold.

39
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:57,840
Look at the fireworks.

40
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,199
You might get burned.

41
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,039
Su Yan.

42
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:14,000
I heard

43
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:17,800
couples who kiss under fireworks

44
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,240
stay happy forever.

45
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,960
♪Not every memory that stays♪

46
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:28,280
♪Deserves to be etched in your heart♪

47
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,920
♪Not every love♪

48
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:32,080
♪Can give you a place to belong♪

49
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,840
♪You don't have to make this hard♪

50
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:37,160
♪I'll be the one to walk away♪

51
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,320
♪Not every goodbye♪

52
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:43,560
♪Means betraying what was real♪

53
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,199
Fireworks are beautiful,

54
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:47,160
♪Bound by love♪

55
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:49,320
♪How can I let you...♪

56
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:51,199
but they don't last.

57
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:57,000
♪Some love is still there♪

58
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,680
♪But I can't put it into words♪

59
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:02,360
♪Those who love deeply never change♪

60
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,000
Su Yan.

61
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,240
That's exactly why

62
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,840
we should remember

63
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,199
how beautiful this moment is.

64
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,880
♪I was never the one♪

65
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:12,920
♪Just another one♪

66
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:14,520
♪Never your exception♪

67
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,560
♪The more I hurt♪

68
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,640
♪The more I hope♪

69
00:03:17,639 --> 00:03:18,319
Cheng Lin.

70
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:21,319
Let's break up.

71
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,640
♪I was never the one♪

72
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:37,680
♪Just another one♪

73
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,440
♪Never your exception♪

74
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:38,919
Su Yan.

75
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:40,719
Three years.

76
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,439
Just give me three years.

77
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:44,199
Please?

78
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,759
Go be who you want to be.

79
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,840
As for us...

80
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:55,400
this is where it ends.

81
00:04:03,039 --> 00:04:04,439
I will come back.

82
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:07,400
Don't make promises so easily.

83
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:10,840
And don't get your hopes up.

84
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,599
Then you won't be disappointed.

85
00:04:12,599 --> 00:04:14,000
♪For the love you give me♪

86
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,160
♪Our story♪

87
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,320
♪Changed♪

88
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,560
♪With memories overflowing♪

89
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,959
♪How am I supposed to move on?♪

90
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:20,360
Su Yan.

91
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,120
I'll come back.

92
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:25,639
(Some people are only meant to)

93
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,519
(cross paths.)

94
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,680
(What we had)

95
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,000
(was never shameful.)

96
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,759
(No one got destroyed.)

97
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:34,800
(This is the best way to end it.)

98
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:36,959
(Cheng Lin.)

99
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,199
(The world is wide open.)

100
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,600
(I wish you nothing but the best.)

101
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,199
Here.

102
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:50,000
So what if he's a rich heir now?

103
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:51,879
He's still crazy about you.

104
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:53,480
You could make long-distance work.

105
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,759
Why break up?

106
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,199
Actually, that day,

107
00:05:01,079 --> 00:05:02,439
I knew he was behind the screen.

108
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:06,520
So you've never thought about
a future with him?

109
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,000
Never.

110
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:11,680
If he wants to leave

111
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,880
or stay,

112
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,520
that's his choice.

113
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:20,680
If he wants to go,

114
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,519
why should I stop him?

115
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:24,800
At nineteen,

116
00:05:25,519 --> 00:05:27,360
he wants a bright future

117
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,600
to prove what he's capable of.

118
00:05:29,399 --> 00:05:31,199
He wants an epic love

119
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:33,120
to prove that he's loved.

120
00:05:33,519 --> 00:05:34,439
He wants everything.

121
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,600
He wants to hold on to it all.

122
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:37,839
Isn't that normal?

123
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:40,399
I'm thirty
and still want both love and a career.

124
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,959
Once he has everything,

125
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:43,639
he'll end up like my dad.

126
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:44,920
Like Duan Cizhou.

127
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:47,040
Like men who get lost in temptation.

128
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,000
If that's the case,

129
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:51,040
I'd rather end it now.

130
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,399
I see it now.

131
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,040
You don't trust men.

132
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,040
Or love.

133
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:00,519
It's not that I don't believe in them.

134
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:04,560
I'm just afraid to love again.

135
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:08,600
♪Why didn't you ask him to stay?♪

136
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,439
Anything you lean on can give way.

137
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,000
Anyone you trust can walk away.

138
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:14,600
In this world,

139
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:18,800
the only things I can rely on are
my work and myself.

140
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,920
I'm off.

141
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,160
♪You always back away♪

142
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:28,440
♪Why didn't you ask him to stay?♪

143
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:31,760
♪Did you take it all for granted?♪

144
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,040
♪So you let♪

145
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,880
♪All this tenderness♪

146
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,200
♪Vanish in an instant♪

147
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,400
(Su Yan.)

148
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,400
(Tell me.)

149
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:41,480
(What would make you feel better?)

150
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:45,000
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

151
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:48,520
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

152
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:52,040
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

153
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:55,800
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

154
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:14,280
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

155
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:17,920
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

156
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:21,120
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

157
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:24,800
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

158
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:28,200
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

159
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:31,880
♪I hum this song alone♪

160
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:35,720
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

161
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:39,800
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

162
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:43,080
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

163
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:46,680
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

164
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:50,160
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

165
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:55,040
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
